    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DGP201 · Chapter 12 · Session 57 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 57 — Lab 7: Final Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13585 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DGP201 · Chương 12 · Buổi 57 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 57 — Lab 7: Final Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13585 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T,U</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Lab 7: Final Assignment<br>- This assignment will allow you to apply and demonstrate the full range of skills and knowledge acquired throughout the course<br>- This assignment provides an opportunity to express yourself artistically and showcase your acquired skills.<br>- Use AI for ideation, composition, or refinement, and provide references or moodboards with a brief note on their role, while ensuring the final artwork is manually painted.<br><br>Requirements:<br>- Choose a specific genre for your environment with characters. This could be anything from a bustling cityscape, a serene natural setting, a post-apocalyptic world, a fantasy realm, or any other setting that inspires you.<br>- Create a digital painting that features a detailed environment with at least two characters. The environment should include various elements like buildings, nature, and other contextual details that define the setting.<br>* Use AI for ideation, composition, or refinement, and provide references or moodboards with a brief note on their role, while ensuring the final artwork is manually painted.<br>- Students must submit a report, including reference images used, screenshots of process stages: sketch → base → mid-detail → final render, AI outputs + integration notes and the Photoshop working file (.psd with layers).</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>- Slide</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Prepare individual tools needed for the assessments.<br>- Students use observational and visualization drawing as a means to communicate ideas and concepts. Individual work only.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
